{"id":"8ba4c92bb4d3383e","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-sato-tate.md","title":"Sato-Tate","display":"df-sato-tate — Sato-Tate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sato-tate","aliases":["58-df-sato-tate","Sato-Tate"],"display":"df-sato-tate — Sato-Tate","depends_on":["[[58-df-sato-tate-conjecture]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sato-tate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sato-tate</span><span>Sato-Tate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sato-tate — Sato-Tate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afd9c90ddd9c2256\" href=\"?note=afd9c90ddd9c2256\" title=\"58-df-sato-tate-conjecture\">58-df-sato-tate-conjecture</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\in V\">\\(E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)\\)</span> is the registered metatheoretic non-CM Sato--Tate predicate, including good reduction and Frobenius-angle data (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afd9c90ddd9c2256\" href=\"?note=afd9c90ddd9c2256\" title=\"58-df-sato-tate-conjecture\">58-df-sato-tate-conjecture</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SatoTate}_S(E)\">\\(\\operatorname{SatoTate}_S(E)\\)</span> (abbreviation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{SatoTate}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{SatoTate}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom is an alias of the canonical definition.  It no longer treats an arbitrary chosen prime set as the good-reduction primes or uses unregistered point-counting and limit expressions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Barnet-Lamb, Gerard and Taylor, The Sato-Tate Conjecture for Hilbert Modular Forms</li>\n<li>Harris, Shepherd-Barron and Taylor, A Family of Calabi-Yau Manifolds and the Sato-Tate Conjecture</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-sato-tate-conjecture","status":"resolved","id":"afd9c90ddd9c2256","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sato-tate-conjecture]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sato-tate-conjecture","status":"resolved","id":"afd9c90ddd9c2256","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)$ is the registered metatheoretic non-CM Sato--Tate predicate, including good reduction and Frobenius-angle data (see [[58-df-sato-tate-conjecture]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SatoTate}_S(E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sato\\text{-}tate}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\operatorname{SatoTate}_S(E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SatoTateConjecture}_S(E).","display":true}],"bytes":1098,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anch